<span class="stat-label"><strong>Total</strong></span><span class="stat-value"><strong>14,875</strong></span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="callout">
<strong>LEO Dominance.</strong> The 86.5% LEO share reflects the extraordinary scale of mega-constellation deployment &mdash; primarily Starlink, OneWeb, and Planet &mdash; concentrated in shells between ~550 km and ~1,200 km altitude. GEO (4.0%) remains a premium, high-value orbit for communications, weather, and intelligence satellites.
</div>
</div>
